WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.228 line:100%,end
You can attach a PDF or an image to a unit,
a work order and a service log entry.

00:00:07.228 --> 00:00:11.700 line:100%,end
The maintenance person and the administrator add attachments.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.249 line:100%,end
Under Files, choose the kind,
for example Certificate.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:20.100 line:100%,end
Choose the file and click Add a file.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.200 line:100%,end
A file can be up to 10 megabytes.
Images are shrunk automatically.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.351 line:100%,end
Attachments on work orders and service log entries
are added the same way.

00:00:33.351 --> 00:00:40.200 line:100%,end
For example a service manual or a photo of the repair
stays with the right job.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.837 line:100%,end
Tap a file to open it.
Attachments also appear in the service book.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:51.200 line:100%,end
A file can be removed by the person who added it
or by the administrator.
